-//   sum over 128 dims <= 8,323,200 < 2^31 -> int32 is exact, no rounding.
-// The join binary compares dist < (float)sqrt(radius)^2; with radius = m^2
-// (m <= 4095) and integer data, the float32 chain is exact as well, so the
